Lewica's legal team, abortion-rights organisers and hospital unions publish one
record of threats delivered through anti-restriction channels: named abuse of
women's-strike activists, doctors and left councillors, and calls to "punish"
local officials accused of sanitary "treason."

The file does not dismantle the network. It does prevent Konfederacja from
pretending this is only a tax revolt with no social enemies.

- @poland_hub: Continue


