go-to: budget_2021_ratification

@budget_2021_ratification
title: The five-caucus vote
new-page: true
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
const clamp21 = value => Math.max(0, Math.min(100, value));
const common21 =
    42 + Q.party_unity * 0.34 -
    Math.max(0, Q.budget_promises) * 0.7 -
    Q.budget_breaches * 2.5;
const support21 = {
    barons: common21 - Q.barons_dissent * 0.55,
    spring: common21 - Q.spring_dissent * 0.55,
    labor: common21 - Q.labor_dissent * 0.55,
    progressives: common21 - Q.progressives_dissent * 0.55,
    razem: common21 - Q.razem_dissent * 0.55,
    pps: common21 - Q.pps_dissent * 0.55,
    social_patriot: common21 - Q.social_patriot_dissent * 0.55
};
if (Q.budget_2021_package_code == 1) {
    support21.barons += 4;
    support21.spring += 7;
    support21.labor += 13;
    support21.progressives += 9;
    support21.razem += 15;
    support21.pps += 12;
}
if (Q.budget_2021_package_code == 2) {
    support21.barons += 13;
    support21.spring -= 3;
    support21.labor += 5;
    support21.progressives -= 9;
    support21.razem -= 16;
    support21.pps += 3;
}
if (Q.budget_2021_package_code == 3) {
    support21.barons += 7;
    support21.spring += 5;
    support21.labor += 3;
    support21.progressives += 4;
    support21.razem += 2;
    support21.pps += 5;
}
if (Q.budget_2021_package_code == 4) {
    support21.barons += 2;
    support21.spring += 2;
    support21.progressives += 2;
    support21.pps += 2;
}
for (const key of Object.keys(support21)) {
    support21[key] = clamp21(support21[key]);
}
const strength21 = Q.factions.reduce(
    (total, caucus) => total + Q[caucus + "_strength"],
    0
);
const weighted21 = Q.factions.reduce(
    (total, caucus) =>
        total + support21[caucus] * Q[caucus + "_strength"],
    0
);
Q.budget_2021_backing = Math.round(weighted21 / Math.max(1, strength21));
Q.budget_2021_vetoes = Q.factions.filter(
    caucus => support21[caucus] < 35
).length;
Q.budget_2021_ratified =
    Q.budget_2021_package_code != 4 &&
    Q.budget_2021_backing >= 54 &&
    Q.budget_2021_vetoes <= 1 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.budget_2021_ratified) {
    Q.party_unity += 4;
    Q.public_trust += 2;
    Q.senate_cohesion += 2;
    Q.senate_last_vote = "Common 2022 budget opposition line";
    Q.news_headline = "The Left survives the 2021 budget vote";
} else {
    Q.party_unity -= Q.budget_2021_backing >= 40 ? 5 : 9;
    Q.public_trust -= 3;
    Q.senate_cohesion -= 3;
    Q.senate_last_vote = "Left caucuses split on the 2022 budget";
    Q.news_headline = "The 2021 budget vote opens another Left fracture";
}
!}

= The caucus decides what it can defend

[? if budget_2021_ratified: Delegates authorise **[+ budget_2021_package +]**
with **[+ budget_2021_backing +]%** support. The dissenting current records its
objection but cannot break the common line. Our MPs enter the Sejm with one
position, and every promise inside it now belongs to the whole Left.?]
[? if not budget_2021_ratified and budget_2021_backing >= 54: A headline
majority—**[+ budget_2021_backing +]%**—backs **[+ budget_2021_package +]**, but
[+ budget_2021_vetoes +] organised currents refuse the discipline required to
carry it together. The party has found a popular compromise without finding a
common vote.?]
[? if not budget_2021_ratified and budget_2021_backing >= 40 and budget_2021_backing < 54:
**[+ budget_2021_package +]** wins only **[+ budget_2021_backing +]%**. That is
enough to keep bargaining alive and too little to bind the caucus. Each current
will now explain its own budget vote, while PiS explains the fracture for all
of us.?]
[? if not budget_2021_ratified and budget_2021_backing < 40: The proposed line
collapses at **[+ budget_2021_backing +]%**. **[+ budget_2021_package +]** has
united neither the governing pragmatists nor the opposition purists; the Sejm
will see several Lefts where voters were promised one.?]

- @december_2021_hub: Return to the December desk

@dec21_finish
title: Close 2021
