@jan22_tax_revolt
title: Make simplicity and lower contributions the whole answer
subtitle: Chase self-employed and professional voters by abandoning the redistributive defence.
on-arrival: left_economic_position += 6; left_right_score += 5; market_liberal_support += 10; liberal_professionals_left_affinity += 2; labor_dissent += 8; razem_dissent += 10; progressives_dissent += 4; konf_poll_momentum += 0.2; news_headline = "The Left enters Konfederacja's tax terrain"

Our speakers stop distinguishing design from administration and promise lower
contributions as the answer to both. Some professionals and small employers
hear a Left willing to acknowledge the burden they actually received.

Trade unionists and Razem hear the party concede Konfederacja's premise: that
the social state is chiefly an invoice. The radical right welcomes the argument
and asks voters to choose its original rather than our revision.

