Lawyers and aid groups place the open reception of Ukrainians beside the
pushbacks still reported on the Belarusian frontier. Lewica demands that
nationality and the route of arrival cannot erase the right to seek protection.

The comparison restores a principle the emergency had obscured. Border officers
and security-minded voters reply that Lukashenko's operation and Putin's
invasion are not administered in the same conditions; PiS uses that difference
to avoid the legal question altogether.

