Mining unions and coal-region mayors receive a guarantee against closures made
in the middle of an energy emergency. The line reassures workers who have heard
too many national plans treat their communities as a footnote.

Temporary extraction acquires contractors, payrolls and a parliamentary
constituency almost immediately. Climate organisers warn that the retreat will
outlive the emergency unless Lewica attaches a dated route back out.

