Our negotiators put a minimum social programme, Senate coordination, winnable
places and a transparent subsidy formula in one document. KO and Poland 2050
must answer terms rather than ask Lewica to demonstrate virtue by disappearing.

The conditions preserve internal support and cost an organisational month.
They may also give Tusk a ready explanation if the talks fail: the Left priced
unity too highly.

