KO, Poland 2050 and Lewica sign one test for judicial independence and agree
that Commission approval cannot certify institutions it has not yet examined.
Morawiecki loses the ability to sell a different minimum repair to each club.

The common standard improves opposition discipline. It also places Lewica
beside KO on a constitutional stage where our social conditions receive less
attention.

