Accountants and professional associations help us reduce the next correction
to rules employers and workers can actually calculate. The competence argument
reaches people who stopped listening after January's contradictory guidance.

It does less for wages already losing purchasing power. KO finds the proposal
easy to adopt, while unions and Razem ask why technical simplicity became the
Left's principal answer to a distributional crisis.

- @poland_hub: Continue


