@august_2022
# prose-audit: Grade A — The Oder disaster is carried by river towns, regulators, industry and the German border, with every response distinguishing evidence, authority and political ownership.
title: Mass fish deaths in the Oder
face-image: img/poland/events/oder-disaster-2022.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: odra_2022_done = 1; climate_state_capacity -= 4; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "Mass fish deaths expose a failure of warning and response"

= August 2022 — A visible failure of regulation

Tonnes of dead fish appear along the Oder before central authorities can give
river towns a reliable warning. **Polish Waters**, environmental inspectorates,
industrial users and regional governments hold different pieces of the record;
communities downstream receive the consequences before they receive an agreed
explanation. German authorities across the river are investigating the same
water under another chain of command.

Lewica can pursue the evidence, build local response capacity, internationalise
the inquiry or reduce the catastrophe to another ministerial scandal. Those
choices will decide whether anything remains after the culprit leaves the news.

- @aug22_transparency
- @aug22_local
- @aug22_joint
- @aug22_attack

@aug22_transparency
title: Demand live monitoring, disclosure and regulatory enforcement
subtitle: Build the public evidence needed for enforcement before naming a convenient culprit.
on-arrival: administrative_reform_pressure += 7; public_trust += 4; progressive_credibility += 2; industrial_logistics_left_affinity -= 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposal"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "The Left demands a monitoring system, not a culprit of convenience"

Scientists, anglers and local officials join a demand for continuous readings,
automatic public warnings and disclosed industrial permits. The proposal gives
prosecutors and regulators a chain of evidence that will survive the first
ministerial resignation.

Industrial users resist automatic disclosure and warn against verdicts before
sampling is complete. Lewica accepts that caution without accepting secrecy.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug22_local
title: Put river towns and local services in command
subtitle: Give downstream communities warning and response capacity while the national inquiry continues.
on-arrival: local_network += 5; psl_relation += 3; administrative_reform_pressure += 4; media_capacity += 1; last_policy_stage = "Advocacy"; last_policy_authority = "Opposition local network"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "Oder towns document the response the centre failed to provide"

Mayors, volunteer fire brigades, water utilities and anglers establish a shared
warning chain along the river. Their logs show when the contamination arrived
and which central office failed to pass information downstream.

PSL welcomes authority close to the affected communities. Local coordination
can protect the next town; it cannot compel an industrial plant or national
regulator without legislation.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug22_joint
title: Seek a Polish–German inquiry and warning protocol
subtitle: Follow the river across the frontier and accept a new nationalist attack.
on-arrival: administrative_reform_pressure += 5; ko_relation += 3; p2050_relation += 2; public_trust += 2; far_right_agenda += 1; last_policy_stage = "Proposed inquiry"; last_policy_authority = "Parliamentary opposition"; last_policy_implementation = 0; news_headline = "A cross-border inquiry proposal follows the river rather than the rhetoric"

Polish and German laboratories receive a proposal for shared samples, alerts
and publication rules. The protocol reflects the physical fact PiS rhetoric
cannot alter: contamination and dead fish cross the border in the same water.

KO and Poland 2050 support the inquiry. The nationalist right calls German
participation foreign supervision, turning an environmental failure into
another sovereignty test.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@aug22_attack
title: Make ministerial incompetence the whole story
subtitle: Win the immediate scandal and leave the monitoring system for somebody else to design.
on-arrival: public_trust += 1; media_capacity += 2; administrative_reform_pressure -= 2; ko_relation += 1; konf_poll_momentum += 0.1; news_headline = "The scandal lands before a durable river policy"

Our MPs assemble missed warnings and contradictory statements into a devastating
case against the responsible ministers. Television understands the accusation
immediately, and the government spends the week defending its chronology.

No common monitoring rule, local warning chain or cross-border protocol follows
from the attack. Once the minister changes, the river returns to the same
institutions that failed it.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@september_2022
# prose-audit: Grade A — The winter price shock is grounded in households, services, firms and energy ownership, with four distinct settlements and candid factional consequences.
title: The price of winter
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
