= The annual test under wartime pressure

War changes the slogans but not the struggle over who may speak for the nation.
Anti-Ukrainian messages remain available to the radical fringe.

The Left is no longer starting from zero: **[+ civic_independence_years +]
civic commemoration(s)** and **[+ independence_monitor_years +] monitoring
operation(s)** survive in the organisational ledger. Repeating a line
strengthens an institution; changing it leaves somebody holding an unused
network.

[? if independence_join_years > 0: The social-patriotic current also retains
contacts from [+ independence_join_years +] previous appearance(s) inside the
main march. Under wartime conditions, using them means answering for the
anti-Ukrainian fringe rather than pretending it is absent.?]

- @nov22_civic
- @nov22_join
