= November 2022 — The same channels, sharper enemies

Accounts that grew during pandemic and anti-abortion mobilisation now circulate
lists of "unsafe" schools, shelters and border towns allegedly "captured by
Ukrainians and the left." Konfederacja's formal spokespeople keep legal distance,
while local sympathisers test patrol and "self-defence" rhetoric that can turn
one rumour into a street confrontation.

- @nov22_konf_preempt
- @nov22_konf_record
