= December 2022 — The year-end vote

The government asks us to weigh defence and refugee services against energy
bills, hospitals, housing and wages. We can present one answer, join a broader
security line, bargain directly with PiS or let our factions vote their own
priorities.

- @budget22_common
- @budget22_security
- @budget22_deal
- @budget22_fragments

@budget_2022_cabinet
# prose-audit: Grade A — The wartime budget is written from inside the PiS coalition, with authority and blame attached to Lewica's ministries.
title: A war budget with our names on it
new-page: true
face-image: img/poland/cards/government-affairs.webp

= December 2022 — Solidarity has a balance sheet

Refugee services, defence procurement, hospital bills and the energy shield
now compete inside a cabinet we sustain. PiS controls the security ministries;
Lewica ministers are expected to absorb the social consequences. Morawiecki
wants one disciplined vote and no public argument over which side of the
coalition paid for it.

Razem can oppose the whole settlement from outside. We must decide what our
offices are for.

- @budget22_cabinet_shield
- @budget22_cabinet_security
- @budget22_cabinet_brink

