Our speakers refuse both the state's canonisation and the lazy claim that Polish
Catholicism is one guilty body. Parish Catholics willing to open the archives
find room beside secular campaigners. Harder voices on both sides call it
evasion; survivors at least keep their claim to facts rather than symbols.

- @poland_hub: Continue


@mar23_avoid
